     *** Pumping ***                                                                 
     *** Pumping from downstream dewatering wells is removed from AGWS               
     *** divide cfs by Area (717.75 ac) * 1.008333 to convert to inches              
     WDM1   401 PUMP     ENGL    -1.382e-3 SAME PERLND 185     EXTNL  AGWLI          
     *** and added to local reaches based on location                                
     *** multiply monthly average cfs by 0.0826 to convert to ac-ft/hr               
     WDM1   403 PUMP     ENGL      0.0826  SAME RCHRES   7     INFLOW IVOL           
     WDM1   404 PUMP     ENGL      0.0826  SAME RCHRES   8     INFLOW IVOL           
