     WDM1   407 PUMP     ENGL      0.0826  SAME RCHRES  92     INFLOW IVOL           
                                                                                     
     *** Pumping from supply wells in Tapo Canyon is removed from AGWS               
     *** Divide cfs by Area (6863.43 ac) * 1.008333 to convert to inches             
     WDM1   402 PUMP     ENGL    -1.445e-4 SAME PERLND 101     EXTNL  AGWLI          
     *** Water is exported to water treatment plant                                  
                                                                                     
